#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:4
msgid "Design notes: the parallel execution layer"
msgstr "设计笔记：并行执行层"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:8
msgid ""
"This page records the design of the :doc:`parallel execution layer <parallel_execution>` — the requirements that shaped it, the invariants that make parallel runs trustworthy, and the reasoning "
"behind the visible interfaces. It explains *why*; :doc:`parallel_execution` is the practical guide, and the hook-contract tests (``test/test_hook_contract.py``) are the executable form of the rules "
"stated here."
msgstr "本页记录 :doc:`并行执行层 <parallel_execution>` 的设计——塑造它的需求、让并行运行值得信赖的不变式，以及各可见接口背后的理由。它解释的是 *为什么* ； :doc:`parallel_execution` 是实操指南，而钩子契约测试（ ``test/test_hook_contract.py`` ）则是本页所述规则的可执行形态。"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:16
msgid "Problem and requirements"
msgstr "问题与需求"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:18
msgid ""
"fl-sim simulates every client and the server inside one Python process. Historically the clients' local steps ran strictly sequentially, so the wall-clock time of a round is proportional to the "
"number of sampled clients — the dominant cost once models are non-trivial."
msgstr "fl-sim 在同一个 Python 进程内模拟所有客户端与服务器。历史上客户端的本地步严格串行执行，因此一轮的墙钟时间与被采样客户端的数量成正比——一旦模型不再平凡，这就是主导成本。"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:23
msgid "The requirements that shaped the design:"
msgstr "塑造本设计的需求："

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:25
msgid "**Scale**: tens to a few hundred clients, up to about a thousand; built-in models range from a few KiB to tens of MiB."
msgstr " **规模** ：几十到几百个客户端，上限约一千；内置模型从几 KiB 到数十 MiB。"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:27
msgid "**Devices**: CPU and GPU both matter."
msgstr " **设备** ：CPU 与 GPU 都在考虑范围内。"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:28
msgid "**Reproducibility**: statistical-level reproducibility is acceptable for parallel runs; bitwise reproducibility stays guaranteed for the default sequential path."
msgstr " **可复现性** ：并行运行下统计级的可复现性即可接受；默认的 sequential 路径保持逐位可复现的保证。"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:31
msgid "**Dependencies**: heavy dependencies (Ray and friends) may only ever enter as optional backends."
msgstr " **依赖** ：重依赖（Ray 之类）只允许以可选后端的形式进入。"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:33
msgid "The existing architecture is not a constraint: the main loop, the client/server responsibility split and the per-algorithm upload protocol were all allowed to change."
msgstr "既有架构不构成约束：主循环、客户端/服务器的职责划分、逐算法的上行协议都允许改动。"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:37
msgid ""
"Prior work falls into three schools. Process-based simulators isolate clients in worker processes (strong isolation, serialization cost). Thread-based shared-memory designs keep clients in one "
"process (cheap state access, GIL discipline required). Vectorized/functional designs (batch the whole population with ``vmap``, as in FedJAX) achieve the best throughput but require rewriting every "
"model and algorithm in functional form — a different framework. fl-sim takes the second path with a contract that keeps the third and the first reachable."
msgstr "既有工作分三个流派。基于进程的模拟器把客户端隔离在工作进程中（隔离性强，有序列化成本）。基于线程的共享内存设计把客户端留在同一进程内（状态访问廉价，需要 GIL 纪律）。向量化/函数式设计（如 FedJAX 用 ``vmap`` 批量处理整个种群）吞吐量最高，但要求把每个模型与算法都改写成函数式——那是另一个框架。fl-sim 走第二条路，同时以契约保持第一、第三条路可达。"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:47
msgid "Goals and non-goals"
msgstr "目标与非目标"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:49
msgid "Goals:"
msgstr "目标："

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:51
msgid "measurable wall-clock speedup on multi-core CPU and single/multi GPU;"
msgstr "在多核 CPU 与单/多 GPU 上取得可测量的墙钟加速；"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:52
msgid "zero semantic change to the 20 built-in algorithms — algorithms only went through one framework-managed protocol migration;"
msgstr "对 20 个内置算法零语义改动——算法侧只经历一次由框架统一代办的上行协议迁移；"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:54
msgid ""
"the default ``sequential`` backend is **bitwise identical** to the pre-parallel implementation: communication counters (including the \"empty\" +1 of conditional broadcasts), log ordering, the "
"counting semantics of communication-skipping algorithms, and client model trajectories;"
msgstr "默认的 ``sequential`` 后端与并行化之前的实现 **逐位一致** ：通信计数（含条件性广播时的\"空 +1\"）、日志顺序、通信跳过算法的计数语义，以及客户端的模型轨迹；"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:59
msgid "a three-level reproducibility promise (below);"
msgstr "三级可复现性承诺（见下）；"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:60
msgid "the executor abstraction must not change when new backends arrive;"
msgstr "新后端到来时执行器抽象不必改变；"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:61
msgid "no new mandatory dependencies (standard-library ``concurrent.futures`` plus what PyTorch/NumPy already provide)."
msgstr "不引入新的必选依赖（标准库 ``concurrent.futures`` 加上 PyTorch/NumPy 自带能力）。"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:64
msgid "Explicit non-goals, with the reasons:"
msgstr "明确的非目标及其理由："

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:66
msgid "**Ray / multi-machine execution** — no distributed use case; the interface keeps it reachable as an optional backend;"
msgstr " **Ray / 多机执行** ——没有分布式场景；接口保持其以可选后端形式加入的可能；"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:68
msgid "**vectorized simulation** — equivalent to rewriting the framework;"
msgstr " **向量化仿真** ——等于重写框架；"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:69
msgid "**discrete-event simulation** — orthogonal (a tool for system performance evaluation, not for accelerating real computation);"
msgstr " **离散事件仿真** ——正交（那是系统性能评估的工具，不是加速真实计算的手段）；"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:71
msgid "**bitwise cross-run reproducibility under parallelism** — accepted at statistical level by design decision; the sequential path keeps bitwise behavior;"
msgstr " **并行下的逐位跨运行可复现** ——经设计决策接受统计级；sequential 路径保持逐位行为；"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:74
msgid "**client memory optimization** — buffering all uploads of a round is pre-existing behavior; parallelization neither changes nor optimizes it;"
msgstr " **客户端内存优化** ——缓冲一轮全部上传是既有行为；并行化既不改变它也不优化它；"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:77
msgid "**asynchronous / staleness algorithm semantics** — designed as bulk synchronous;"
msgstr " **异步/陈旧性算法语义** ——按批量同步设计；"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:79
msgid "**experiment-level parallelism** — running many experiments in parallel (``fl_sim/utils/multiprocessing.py``) is orthogonal to client-level parallelism and intentionally untouched."
msgstr " **实验级并行** ——并行跑多个实验（ ``fl_sim/utils/multiprocessing.py`` ）与客户端级并行正交，有意不去触碰。"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:84
msgid "Design principles: state-ownership invariants"
msgstr "设计原则：状态归属不变式"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:86
msgid "Two invariants carry the entire design:"
msgstr "两条不变式撑起整个设计："

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:88
msgid ""
"**I1 (client-task enclosure)** — code running in the parallel region may only read and write *its own client's* state plus read-only shared data; server-side state is untouchable. Enforced "
"mechanically by AST contract tests: the audited touch-set of every client hook is pinned, a static name blacklist is a cheap pre-filter and a runtime ``isinstance(v, Server)`` check is the real "
"gatekeeper."
msgstr " **I1（客户端任务封闭性）** ——并行区内的代码只允许读写 *本客户端自己的* 状态与只读共享数据；服务器侧状态不可触碰。由 AST 契约测试机械守护：每个客户端钩子的审计触达集合被钉死，静态名字黑名单作廉价前置筛，运行期 ``isinstance(v, Server)`` 检查才是真正的守门人。"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:95
msgid "**I2 (server single-threadedness)** — every server-side state change happens on the main thread, in the fixed sampled-client order within each round."
msgstr " **I2（服务器单线程性）** ——所有服务器侧状态的变更只发生在主线程，且每轮内按固定的被采样客户端顺序发生。"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:99
msgid ""
"Together they yield the **arithmetic-equivalence corollary**: given each client's inputs (the downlink message, or none) and outputs (the uplink message, or none), the arithmetic sequence of the "
"aggregation stage is independent of the execution backend. Backends only change how the clients' local trajectories are scheduled concurrently — never the aggregation arithmetic. The threads backend"
" enforces the invariants by convention, code structure and CI assertions; a process backend would enforce them by physical isolation. One contract covers both."
msgstr "两者合起来得到 **算术等价性推论** ：给定每个客户端的输入（下行消息，或没有）与输出（上行消息，或没有），聚合阶段的算术序列与执行后端无关。后端只改变客户端本地轨迹被并发调度的方式——从不改变聚合算术。threads 后端靠约定、代码结构与 CI 断言来执行这两条不变式；进程后端将靠物理隔离执行。一套契约覆盖两者。"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:109
msgid "The executor abstraction"
msgstr "执行器抽象"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:111
msgid "Backends implement a single interface::"
msgstr "所有后端实现同一个接口："

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:116
msgid "The contract:"
msgstr "契约内容："

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:118
msgid ""
"``map`` applies ``fn`` element-wise and returns results **in the order of ``items``** — never in completion order. Consuming results in completion order would let the floating-point aggregation "
"order drift with the scheduler; progress reporting is carried separately by ``on_complete(result, index)``, invoked on the main thread as soon as each task finishes."
msgstr " ``map`` 逐元素应用 ``fn`` 并 **按 ``items`` 的顺序** 返回结果——绝不按完成顺序。按完成序消费结果会让浮点聚合顺序随调度器漂移；进度报告由 ``on_complete(result, index)`` 单独承载，每个任务一完成就在主线程上被调用。"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:124
msgid ""
"task exceptions propagate as the original exception chained with the client id (``raise ... from exc``); not-yet-started tasks are cancelled best-effort, already-running tasks are allowed to finish "
"(documented as-is);"
msgstr "任务异常以原异常链上客户端 id 的形式传播（ ``raise ... from exc`` ）；尚未开始的任务尽力取消，已在运行的任务允许跑完（如实文档化）；"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:128
msgid "the object is a context manager: entering saves and applies execution resources (the torch intra-op thread budget), exiting restores them."
msgstr "该对象是上下文管理器：进入时保存并应用执行资源（torch 算子内线程预算），退出时恢复。"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:131
msgid "``map`` instead of futures is deliberate: exposing futures would tempt callers to move state changes into the concurrent region, breaking I2."
msgstr "用 ``map`` 而不是 future 是有意为之：暴露 future 会诱使调用者把状态变更搬进并发区，破坏 I2。"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:135
msgid "Task decomposition per round"
msgstr "每轮的任务切分"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:137
msgid "Each round splits into a serial main-thread part (inherently cheap) and a parallel part (the expensive local steps):"
msgstr "每一轮切分为串行的主线程部分（本就便宜）与并行部分（昂贵的本地步）："

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:140
msgid ""
"**Main thread** — the per-algorithm uplink decision (``Server._decide_uplink``; only communication-skipping algorithms override it, and the RNG consumption for it moves onto the serial main-thread "
"path), then the downlink broadcast (``Server.communicate(target)``) with **per-algorithm semantics preserved as-is**: APFL broadcasts conditionally on ``n_iter % tau``, FedPD on the previous round's"
" participation set, everything else unconditionally. \"Skips the uplink this round\" and \"receives no downlink this round\" are independent mechanisms."
msgstr ""
" **主线程** ——逐算法的上行决策（ ``Server._decide_uplink`` ；只有通信跳过型算法覆写它，且其 RNG 消费回到主线程串行路径），随后是下行广播（ ``Server.communicate(target)`` ）， **逐算法语义原样保留** ：APFL 按 ``n_iter % tau`` 条件下发，FedPD "
"按上一轮的参与集合条件下发，其余无条件。\"本轮跳过上行\"与\"本轮收不到下行\"是两个独立的机制。"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:149
msgid ""
"**Parallel region** — the per-client task: evaluate (on evaluation rounds) → local training → build the reply. The task **always** evaluates and trains; only the reply is conditional. Skipping the "
"uplink never skips training, evaluation or metric logging — otherwise the personalized models of communication-skipping algorithms would stop evolving."
msgstr " **并行区** ——逐客户端任务：评估（评估轮）→ 本地训练 → 构建回复。任务 **总是** 评估、总是训练；只有回复是条件性的。"

#: ../../source/parallel_execution_design.rst:155
msgid "**Main thread** — replies are consumed in sampled-client order; the communication counter follows the per-algorithm semantics (ProxSkip counts skipped clients, FedPD does not)."
msgstr " **主线程** ——回复按被采样客户端顺序被消费；通信计数遵循逐算法语义（ProxSkip 给跳过的客户端计数，FedPD 不计）。"

